    - Term: uitips_discord_tips1
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "\u52A0\u5165\u6211\u4EEC\u7684Discord\uFF0C\u83B7\u53D6\u72EC\u5BB6\u5151\u6362\u7801\u548C\u5956\u52B1\uFF01"
      - "\u52A0\u5165\u6211\u5011\u7684Discord\uFF0C\u7372\u53D6\u7368\u5BB6\u514C\u63DB\u78BC\u548C\u734E\u52F5\uFF01"
      - Join our Discord for exclusive codes and rewards!
      - "Tritt unserem Discord f\xFCr exklusive Codes und Belohnungen bei!"
      - "\u9650\u5B9A\u30B3\u30FC\u30C9\u3068\u5831\u916C\u3092\u30B2\u30C3\u30C8\u3057\u3088\u3046\uFF01Discord\u306B\u53C2\u52A0\u3057\u3066\u306D\uFF01"
      - "\uB3C5\uC810 \uCF54\uB4DC\uC640 \uBCF4\uC0C1\uC744 \uBC1B\uC73C\uB824\uBA74
        \uC6B0\uB9AC Discord\uC5D0 \uCC38\uC5EC\uD558\uC138\uC694!"
      - "Rejoignez notre Discord pour obtenir des codes exclusifs et des r\xE9compenses
        !"
      - Unisciti al nostro Discord per codici esclusivi e ricompense!
      - "Do\u0142\u0105cz do naszego Discorda, aby zdoby\u0107 ekskluzywne kody i
        nagrody!"
      - "G\xE5 med i v\xE5r Discord f\xF6r exklusiva koder och bel\xF6ningar!"
      - "\xA1\xDAnete a nuestro Discord para obtener c\xF3digos exclusivos y recompensas!"
      - "Al\u0103tur\u0103-te Discordu-ului nostru pentru coduri exclusive \u0219i
        recompense!"
      - "P\u0159ipojte se k na\u0161emu Discordu pro exkluzivn\xED k\xF3dy a odm\u011Bny!"
      - "\u041F\u0440\u0438\u0441\u043E\u0435\u0434\u0438\u043D\u044F\u0439\u0442\u0435\u0441\u044C
        \u043A \u043D\u0430\u0448\u0435\u043C\u0443 Discord, \u0447\u0442\u043E\u0431\u044B
        \u043F\u043E\u043B\u0443\u0447\u0438\u0442\u044C \u044D\u043A\u0441\u043A\u043B\u044E\u0437\u0438\u0432\u043D\u044B\u0435
        \u043A\u043E\u0434\u044B \u0438 \u043D\u0430\u0433\u0440\u0430\u0434\u044B!"
      Flags: 0000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: uitips_discord_title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "<color=#B75B47>\u6FC0\u6D3B</color> <color=#56A9FF>\u68A6\u60F3\u901A\u884C\u8BC1</color>
        <color=#B75B47>\u4EE5\u83B7\u5F97\u6B64\u5956\u52B1!</color>"
      - "<color=#B75B47>\u6FC0\u6D3B</color> <color=#56A9FF>\u5922\u60F3\u901A\u884C\u8B49</color>
        <color=#B75B47>\u4EE5\u7372\u5F97\u6B64\u734E\u52F5!</color>"
      - <color=#B75B47>Activate</color> the <color=#56A9FF>Dream Pass</color> <color=#B75B47>to
        get this reward!</color>
      - <color=#B75B47>Aktiviere</color> den <color=#56A9FF>Traum-Pass</color> <color=#B75B47>,
        um diese Belohnung zu erhalten!</color>
      - "<color=#B75B47>\u30C9\u30EA\u30FC\u30E0\u30D1\u30B9</color>\u3092<color=#B75B47>\u6709\u52B9\u5316</color>\u3057\u3066<color=#56A9FF>\u3053\u306E\u5831\u916C</color>\u3092\u7372\u5F97\u3057\u3088\u3046\uFF01"
      - "<color=#B75B47>\uB4DC\uB9BC \uD328\uC2A4</color>\uB97C <color=#B75B47>\uD65C\uC131\uD654</color>\uD558\uC5EC
        <color=#56A9FF>\uC774 \uBCF4\uC0C1</color>\uC744 \uBC1B\uC73C\uC138\uC694!"
      - "<color=#B75B47>Activez</color> le <color=#56A9FF>Passe R\xEAve</color> <color=#B75B47>pour
        obtenir cette r\xE9compense !</color>"
      - <color=#B75B47>Attiva</color> il <color=#56A9FF>Pass Sogno</color> <color=#B75B47>per
        ottenere questa ricompensa!</color>
      - "<color=#B75B47>Aktywuj</color> <color=#56A9FF>Przepustk\u0119 Marze\u0144</color>
        <color=#B75B47>, aby otrzyma\u0107 t\u0119 nagrod\u0119!</color>"
      - "<color=#B75B47>Aktivera</color> <color=#56A9FF>Dr\xF6mpasset</color> <color=#B75B47>f\xF6r
        att f\xE5 denna bel\xF6ning!</color>"
      - "\xA1<color=#B75B47>Activa</color> el <color=#56A9FF>Pase de Sue\xF1os</color>
        <color=#B75B47>para obtener esta recompensa!</color>"
      - "<color=#B75B47>Activeaz\u0103</color> <color=#56A9FF>Pass-ul de Vis</color>
        <color=#B75B47>pentru a primi aceast\u0103 recompens\u0103!</color>"
      - "<color=#B75B47>Aktivujte</color> <color=#56A9FF>Pr\u016Fkaz sn\u016F</color>
        <color=#B75B47>, abyste z\xEDskali tuto odm\u011Bnu!</color>"
      - "<color=#B75B47>\u0410\u043A\u0442\u0438\u0432\u0438\u0440\u0443\u0439\u0442\u0435</color>
        <color=#56A9FF>\u041C\u0435\u0447\u0442\u0430-\u043F\u0440\u043E\u043F\u0443\u0441\u043A</color>
