    - Term: uitps_ad_tip
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "\u6C38\u8FDC\u544A\u522B\u5F3A\u5236\u5F39\u51FA\u7684\u7A97\u53E3\u5E7F\u544A\u548C\u6A2A\u5E45\u5E7F\u544A!"
      - "\u6C38\u9060\u544A\u5225\u5F37\u5236\u5F48\u51FA\u7684\u8996\u7A97\u5EE3\u544A\u548C\u6A6B\u5E45\u5EE3\u544A!"
      - Say goodbye to forced pop-up ads and banner ads forever!
      - "Verabschieden Sie sich f\xFCr immer von erzwungenen Pop-up-Anzeigen und
        Banner-Anzeigen!"
      - "\u5F37\u5236\u30DD\u30C3\u30D7\u30A2\u30C3\u30D7\u5E83\u544A\u3068\u30D0\u30CA\u30FC\u5E83\u544A\u306B\u6C38\u9060\u306B\u5225\u308C\u3092\u544A\u3052\u3088\u3046\uFF01"
      - "\uAC15\uC81C \uD31D\uC5C5 \uAD11\uACE0\uC640 \uBC30\uB108 \uAD11\uACE0\uB97C
        \uC601\uC6D0\uD788 \uC791\uBCC4\uD558\uC138\uC694!"
      - "Dites adieu aux pop-ups publicitaires forc\xE9s et aux banni\xE8res publicitaires
        pour toujours !"
      - "Di' addio per sempre alle pubblicit\xE0 pop-up forzate e alle pubblicit\xE0
        banner!"
      - "Po\u017Cegnaj si\u0119 na zawsze z wymuszonymi wyskakuj\u0105cymi reklamami
        i banerami reklamowymi!"
      - "S\xE4g adj\xF6 till p\xE5tvingade popup-annonser och bannerannonser f\xF6r
        alltid!"
      - "\xA1Di adi\xF3s para siempre a los anuncios emergentes forzados y a los
        anuncios de banner!"
      - "Spune\u021Bi adio pentru totdeauna anun\u021Burilor pop-up for\u021Bate
        \u0219i anun\u021Burilor banner!"
      - "Rozlu\u010Dte se nav\u017Edy s vynucen\xFDmi vyskakovac\xEDmi reklamami
