      - "<color=#56A9FF>Extra-Slot</color><color=#FFFFFF> gibt dir einen zus\xE4tzlichen
        Regalplatz!</color>"
      - "<color=#56A9FF>\u8FFD\u52A0\u30B9\u30ED\u30C3\u30C8</color><color=#FFFFFF>\u3067\u8FFD\u52A0\u306E\u68DA\u30B9\u30ED\u30C3\u30C8\u3092\u30B2\u30C3\u30C8\uFF01</color>"
      - "<color=#56A9FF>\uCD94\uAC00 \uC2AC\uB86F</color><color=#FFFFFF>\uC73C\uB85C
        \uCD94\uAC00 \uC120\uBC18 \uC2AC\uB86F\uC744 \uC5BB\uC73C\uC138\uC694!</color>"
      - "<color=#56A9FF>Emplacement suppl\xE9mentaire</color><color=#FFFFFF> vous
        donne un emplacement d'\xE9tag\xE8re suppl\xE9mentaire !</color>"
      - "<color=#56A9FF>Slot extra</color><color=#FFFFFF> ti d\xE0 uno slot scaffale
        aggiuntivo!</color>"
      - "<color=#56A9FF>Dodatkowe miejsce</color><color=#FFFFFF> daje dodatkowy slot
        na p\xF3\u0142ce!</color>"
      - <color=#56A9FF>Extra plats</color><color=#FFFFFF> ger dig en extra hyllplats!</color>
      - <color=#56A9FF>Espacio extra</color><color=#FFFFFF> te da un espacio adicional
        en el estante!</color>
      - "<color=#56A9FF>Slot suplimentar</color><color=#FFFFFF> \xEE\u021Bi ofer\u0103
        un slot suplimentar pe raft!</color>"
      - "<color=#56A9FF>Extra slot</color><color=#FFFFFF> v\xE1m poskytne dal\u0161\xED
        slot na poli\u010Dce!</color>"
      - "<color=#56A9FF>\u0414\u043E\u043F\u043E\u043B\u043D\u0438\u0442\u0435\u043B\u044C\u043D\u044B\u0439
