    - Term: uitps_guide_tips12
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "<color=#FFFFFF>\u70B9\u51FB\u5176\u4ED6\u4E09\u4E2A\u65B9\u5757\u6765\u6253\u7834</color><color=#56A9FF>\u51B0\u5757</color><color=#FFFFFF>!</color>"
      - "<color=#FFFFFF>\u9EDE\u64CA\u5176\u4ED6\u4E09\u500B\u65B9\u584A\u4F86\u6253\u7834</color><color=#56A9FF>\u51B0\u584A</color><color=#FFFFFF>!</color>"
      - <color=#FFFFFF>Tap the other three blocks to break the</color><color=#56A9FF>
        ice</color><color=#FFFFFF>!</color>
      - "<color=#FFFFFF>Tippe auf die anderen drei Bl\xF6cke, um das</color><color=#56A9FF>
        Eis</color><color=#FFFFFF> zu brechen!</color>"
      - "<color=#FFFFFF>\u4ED6\u306E3\u3064\u306E\u30D6\u30ED\u30C3\u30AF\u3092\u30BF\u30C3\u30D7\u3057\u3066</color><color=#56A9FF>\u6C37</color><color=#FFFFFF>\u3092\u5272\u308D\u3046\uFF01</color>"
      - "<color=#FFFFFF>\uB2E4\uB978 \uC138 \uBE14\uB85D\uC744 \uD0ED\uD558\uC5EC</color><color=#56A9FF>
        \uC5BC\uC74C</color><color=#FFFFFF>\uC744 \uAE68\uC138\uC694!</color>"
      - <color=#FFFFFF>Appuyez sur les trois autres blocs pour briser la</color><color=#56A9FF>
        glace</color><color=#FFFFFF> !</color>
      - <color=#FFFFFF>Tocca gli altri tre blocchi per rompere il</color><color=#56A9FF>
        ghiaccio</color><color=#FFFFFF>!</color>
      - "<color=#FFFFFF>Naci\u015Bnij pozosta\u0142e trzy bloki, aby z\u0142ama\u0107</color><color=#56A9FF>
        l\xF3d</color><color=#FFFFFF>!</color>"
      - "<color=#FFFFFF>Tryck p\xE5 de andra tre blocken f\xF6r att bryta</color><color=#56A9FF>
        isen</color><color=#FFFFFF>!</color>"
      - "<color=#FFFFFF>\xA1Toca los otros tres bloques para romper el</color><color=#56A9FF>
        hielo</color><color=#FFFFFF>!</color>"
      - "<color=#FFFFFF>Atinge celelalte trei blocuri pentru a sparge</color><color=#56A9FF>
        ghea\u021Ba</color><color=#FFFFFF>!</color>"
      - "<color=#FFFFFF>Klepn\u011Bte na dal\u0161\xED t\u0159i bloky a prolomte</color><color=#56A9FF>
        led</color><color=#FFFFFF>!</color>"
      - "<color=#FFFFFF>\u041D\u0430\u0436\u043C\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u043D\u0430 \u0442\u0440\u0438
        \u0434\u0440\u0443\u0433\u0438\u0445 \u0431\u043B\u043E\u043A\u0430, \u0447\u0442\u043E\u0431\u044B
        \u0440\u0430\u0437\u0431\u0438\u0442\u044C</color><color=#56A9FF> \u043B\u0451\u0434</color><color=#FFFFFF>!</color>"
