      - "<color=#FFFFFF>Acum po\u021Bi folosi ace\u0219ti boosteri gratuit!</color>"
      - "<color=#FFFFFF>Nyn\xED m\u016F\u017Eete tyto posilova\u010De pou\u017E\xEDvat
