    - Term: uitps_guide_tips20
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "\u6536\u96C6\u4E09\u4E2A</color><color=#56A9FF>\u96EA\u82B1</color><color=#FFFFFF>\u65B9\u5757\u53EF\u4EE5\u51BB\u7ED3\u65F6\u95F45\u79D2!</color>"
      - "\u6536\u96C6\u4E09\u500B</color><color=#56A9FF>\u96EA\u82B1</color><color=#FFFFFF>\u65B9\u584A\u53EF\u4EE5\u51CD\u7D50\u6642\u95935\u79D2!</color>"
      - Collect three</color><color=#56A9FF> snowflake</color><color=#FFFFFF> blocks
