      - "Sammle drei</color><color=#56A9FF> Schneeflocken</color><color=#FFFFFF>-Bl\xF6cke,
        um die Zeit f\xFCr 5 Sekunden einzufrieren!</color>"
      - "3\u3064\u306E</color><color=#56A9FF>\u96EA\u306E\u7D50\u6676</color><color=#FFFFFF>\u30D6\u30ED\u30C3\u30AF\u3092\u96C6\u3081\u3066\u6642\u9593\u30925\u79D2\u9593\u505C\u6B62\u3055\u305B\u3088\u3046\uFF01</color>"
      - "\uC138 \uAC1C\uC758</color><color=#56A9FF> \uB208\uC1A1\uC774</color><color=#FFFFFF>
        \uBE14\uB85D\uC744 \uBAA8\uC544 \uC2DC\uAC04\uC744 5\uCD08 \uB3D9\uC548 \uBA48\uCD94\uC138\uC694!</color>"
      - Collectez trois blocs</color><color=#56A9FF> flocon de neige</color><color=#FFFFFF>
        pour geler le temps pendant 5 secondes !</color>
      - Raccogli tre blocchi</color><color=#56A9FF> fiocco di neve</color><color=#FFFFFF>
        per congelare il tempo per 5 secondi!</color>
      - "Zbierz trzy bloki</color><color=#56A9FF> p\u0142atka \u015Bniegu</color><color=#FFFFFF>,
        aby zamrozi\u0107 czas na 5 sekund!</color>"
      - "Samla tre</color><color=#56A9FF> sn\xF6flinga</color><color=#FFFFFF>block
        f\xF6r att frysa tiden i 5 sekunder!</color>"
      - "\xA1Recolecta tres bloques de</color><color=#56A9FF> copo de nieve</color><color=#FFFFFF>
        para congelar el tiempo durante 5 segundos!</color>"
      - "Colecteaz\u0103 trei blocuri</color><color=#56A9FF> fulg de z\u0103pad\u0103</color><color=#FFFFFF>
        pentru a \xEEnghe\u021Ba timpul timp de 5 secunde!</color>"
      - "Shrom\xE1\u017Ed\u011Bte t\u0159i bloky</color><color=#56A9FF> sn\u011Bhov\xE9
        vlo\u010Dky</color><color=#FFFFFF>, abyste zmrazili \u010Das na 5 sekund!</color>"
      - "\u0421\u043E\u0431\u0435\u0440\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u0442\u0440\u0438</color><color=#56A9FF>
        \u0441\u043D\u0435\u0436\u0438\u043D\u043A\u0438</color><color=#FFFFFF>,
        \u0447\u0442\u043E\u0431\u044B \u0437\u0430\u043C\u043E\u0440\u043E\u0437\u0438\u0442\u044C
        \u0432\u0440\u0435\u043C\u044F \u043D\u0430 5 \u0441\u0435\u043A\u0443\u043D\u0434!</color>"
