      - "<color=#446ED7>B\u0103\u021B Magic</color> <color=#A24621>poate elimina
        un set de blocuri din zona de joc!</color>"
      - "<color=#446ED7>Kouzeln\xE1 H\u016Flka</color> <color=#A24621>m\u016F\u017Ee
