    - Term: uitps_setting_nohattip
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "\u73B0\u5728\u4E0D\u9700\u8981\u6D17\u724C!"
      - "\u73FE\u5728\u4E0D\u9700\u8981\u6D17\u724C!"
      - No need to shuffle now!
      - Jetzt nicht mischen!
      - "\u4ECA\u30B7\u30E3\u30C3\u30D5\u30EB\u3059\u308B\u5FC5\u8981\u306F\u3042\u308A\u307E\u305B\u3093\uFF01"
      - "\uC9C0\uAE08 \uC154\uD50C\uD560 \uD544\uC694\uAC00 \uC5C6\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4!"
      - "Pas besoin de m\xE9langer maintenant !"
      - "Non c'\xE8 bisogno di mescolare ora!"
      - "Nie trzeba teraz tasowa\u0107!"
      - Inget behov av att blanda nu!
      - "\xA1No es necesario barajar ahora!"
      - "Nu este nevoie s\u0103 amesteci acum!"
      - "Nen\xED t\u0159eba nyn\xED m\xEDchat!"
