      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: uitps_setting_nospringboardtip
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "\u6CA1\u6709\u65B9\u5757\u53EF\u4EE5\u653E\u56DE\u53BB!"
      - "\u6C92\u6709\u65B9\u584A\u53EF\u4EE5\u653E\u56DE\u53BB!"
      - No blocks can be put back!
      - "Keine Bl\xF6cke k\xF6nnen zur\xFCckgelegt werden!"
      - "\u30D6\u30ED\u30C3\u30AF\u3092\u623B\u3059\u3053\u3068\u304C\u3067\u304D\u307E\u305B\u3093\uFF01"
      - "\uBE14\uB85D\uC744 \uB2E4\uC2DC \uB193\uC744 \uC218 \uC5C6\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4!"
      - "Aucun bloc ne peut \xEAtre remis !"
      - "Nessun blocco pu\xF2 essere rimesso!"
      - "\u017Badnych blok\xF3w nie mo\u017Cna od\u0142o\u017Cy\u0107!"
      - "Inga block kan l\xE4ggas tillbaka!"
      - "\xA1No se puede volver a poner ning\xFAn bloque!"
      - "Niciun bloc nu poate fi pus \xEEnapoi!"
      - "\u017D\xE1dn\xE9 bloky nelze vr\xE1tit!"
      - "\u041D\u0435\u0442 \u0431\u043B\u043E\u043A\u043E\u0432, \u0447\u0442\u043E\u0431\u044B
        \u0432\u0435\u0440\u043D\u0443\u0442\u044C!"
      Flags: 0000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: uitps_setting_noundotip
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "\u54CE\u5440!\u6CA1\u6709\u53EF\u64A4\u9500\u7684\u79FB\u52A8!"
